#: templates/dashboard/lan_events.html:18
msgid ""
"What the fabric sensor hears on the peering LAN. Neighbor-discovery "
"anomalies: a new MAC appearing on an existing IP, or a single MAC claiming "
"many IPs (proxy-ARP); events tagged “reflection” are benign re-flooding "
"after a fabric flap. LAN-hygiene detections: a participant MAC sourcing a "
"protocol that does not belong on an exchange (IPv6 router advertisements, "
"DHCP, IGP hellos, discovery protocols…), toned by severity, with the fix."
msgstr ""
"everything the fabric sensor overhears on the peering LAN. neighbor-"
"discovery drama: a new MAC showing up on an IP that's already taken, or one "
"MAC claiming a whole bunch of IPs (proxy-ARP); stuff tagged “reflection” is "
"just harmless re-flooding after the fabric flapped. LAN-hygiene stuff: a "
"participant MAC sending a protocol that has no business on an exchange (IPv6"
" router advertisements, DHCP, IGP hellos, discovery protocols…), color-coded"
" by how bad it is, with the fix."

