"SFMIX runs two route servers (BIRD and OpenBGPD) for redundancy, and peering"
" with both is required so a single route-server failure never leaves a "
"network on read. networks that aren't established on both servers — or whose"
" received-prefix counts don't match — are listed first 🛜"

